+;
+; jquant.asm - sample data conversion and quantization (SSE & MMX)
+;
+; Copyright 2009 Pierre Ossman <ossman@cendio.se> for Cendio AB
+;
+; Based on
+; x86 SIMD extension for IJG JPEG library
+; Copyright (C) 1999-2006, MIYASAKA Masaru.
